WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.569 line:8%
Open the student's correct enrolment and find the exemption controls.

00:00:07.932 --> 00:00:10.384 line:8%
Choose the type and basis.

00:00:10.384 --> 00:00:16.270 line:8%
Enter the value, effective date and reason, plus sponsor details when required.

00:00:17.281 --> 00:00:20.325 line:8%
Save and check the adjusted obligations.

00:00:20.325 --> 00:00:22.861 line:8%
Exemptions are not cash receipts.

00:00:22.861 --> 00:00:26.919 line:8%
Revoke an incorrect award through its recorded action.
